Subject: [PATCH] Add VulnerabilityData feed source for the pre-computed NVD
 inventory

The VulnerabilityData repo scans azurelinux-test's cgmanifest.json against
the NVD JSON 2.0 feeds and publishes an OVAL document plus a per-package
JSON inventory several times a day. This wires that feed into VULNEX:

- sources/vulnerabilitydata.py: cached read-only feed client
- config.py: feed URLs (VULNEX_VULNERABILITYDATA_* env overrides)
- api.py: /api/vulnerability-data[/packages[/name]] endpoints
- cli.py: 'vulnex vuln-data [--package NAME] [--refresh]'
- 13 new tests (68 total pass); verified against the live published feed
